  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-309): (a) A permit expires on the last day of the holder’s birth month following [2] 5 years after the date the permit is issued. (b) Subject to subsection (c) of this section, a permit may be renewed for successive periods of [3] 5 years each if, at the time of an application for renewal, the applicant possesses the qualifications for the issuance of a permit and pays the renewal fee stated in this subtitle."
